    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name likely honors Brooklyn, New York, reflecting settlers’ origins and the era’s trend of naming new communities after eastern cities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brooklyn%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Brooklyn’s post office has been in continuous operation since 1856, serving as a longstanding community hub for over a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
